https://dewbox.ursisha.com/* https://ursisha.com/dewbox/:splat 301!
http://dewbox.ursisha.com/en/* https://ursisha.com/en/dewbox/:splat 301!
http://dewbox.ursisha.com/* https://ursisha.com/dewbox/:splat 301!

# Normalize www to the apex domain
